    {
      "question_id": "q23",
      "question_type": "calculation",
      "points": 10,
      "stem": "为测定某稀盐酸的溶质质量分数，取20g稀盐酸样品，逐滴加入10%的NaOH溶液至恰好完全反应，消耗NaOH溶液8g。计算：",
      "options": {},
      "subquestions": [
        {
          "id": "q23_1",
          "points": 4,
          "stem": "写出反应的化学方程式：____ 。"
        },
        {
          "id": "q23_2",
          "points": 6,
          "stem": "求该稀盐酸的溶质质量分数（写出计算过程）。"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "(1) HCl + NaOH = NaCl + H2O\n(2) 设HCl质量为x。m(NaOH)=8g×10%=0.8g。HCl+NaOH=NaCl+H2O，36.5/40=x/0.8，x=0.73g；质量分数=0.73g/20g×100%=3.65%。",
      "scoring_points": [
        {
          "description": "化学式正确、配平",
          "points": 4
        },
        {
          "description": "算出NaOH质量0.8g",
          "points": 1
        },
        {
          "description": "列出比例式36.5/40=x/0.8",
          "points": 2
        },
        {
          "description": "解得x=0.73g",
          "points": 2
        },
        {
          "description": "结果3.65%",
          "points": 1
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
